          "content": "## Unit purpose\n\nFrames and arches introduce thrust, bending and geometric coupling in ways that a straight beam diagram cannot capture. Hinges may make a system determinate, yet they also create meaningful kinematic behavior. Cables share some visual similarity with arches but carry a fundamentally different internal resultant."
