          "content": "## Unit purpose\n\nMoving actions convert an otherwise static equilibrium model into a placement optimization problem. The influence-line method distinguishes the structural transfer mechanism from the moving vehicle schedule. It is used here as an introduction to quasistatic bridge response rather than a substitute for code-specified traffic-load models."
